note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note seed/qualification/ddc650/nondet.om: negative-control fixture for ddc.om, not a compiler.
note Passed as OM4 (with its own SHA-256 as the pin), it writes the ELF magic followed by the
note monotonic clock, so two "stage1" builds differ and ddc.om must answer INVALID.
global b uchar 12
fn main to int
put b 0 127
put b 1 69
put b 2 76
put b 3 70
t = monons
for i ulong 8
put b add 4 i uchar and shr t mul i 8 255
end
r = write 1 b 0 12
if ne r 12
ret 1
end
ret 0
end
